    "note": "170 W total PoE power (the LS-5130S-20P-PWR-EI-H1 product code is rated 185 W), 30 W maximum a port. Vendor PoE table: 11 ports at 15.4 W (802.3af) or 5 at 30 W (802.3at) - 16 x 30 W does not fit a 170 W budget."
